            "_api_notes": "GET {graph}/act_<digits>/campaigns?fields=id,name,start_time,created_time,status (Graph cursor paging via paging.next). start_time = event_date (YYYY-MM-DD); name = label. Reuses the existing meta-ads OAuth token/ad-account scope -- no new scope. Persisted to context_events (no fact_daily_kpi). AI-53: field names declared from the Graph API docs, to confirm on the live pass (no test account 2026-07-21)."
        }
